0 ECHO BRIDGE - two free pendulums exchange motion through rubber bands
0 Name: echo-bridge.ldr
0 Author: CrispStrobe
0 !LICENSE BSD-3-Clause : see ../licenses/echo-bridge.txt
0 !LDRAW_ORG Unofficial_Model
0 // One hub, one motor A; passive pendulums and two physical 33 mm rubber bands.
0 // Both band records are physical flexible parts, counted separately from rigid placements.
0 // Saved crank points +X. The two equal preloads cancel each vertical pendulum's torque.
0 // Real rear arch, perpendicular feet, three motor mounts and four hub mounts.
0 // Standard geometry is external. No custom geometry or invisible joints.
0 // Install 45610 hub battery for physical use; integral motor cable is routed behind the arch.
